4. Terminal Wrench and harbor (Apache-2.0; git submodules, not vendored)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sft/scripts/eval/prompts/judge_v1.txt reproduces the Terminal Wrench monitor
prompt (https://github.com/few-sh/terminal-wrench, Apache-2.0);
sft/scripts/eval/prompts/judge_v2.txt and judge_v3.txt are modified versions of it.

sft/scripts/eval/patches/harbor_verifier_on_ctx_overflow.patch modifies harbor
(https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor, formerly laude-institute/harbor;
Apache-2.0).

Both projects are referenced as git submodules under sft/third_party/ and are not
redistributed in this repository.

