7. Evaluation records containing third-party model output
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sft/build/jobs/*/judge_scores_judge_v3.json contain outputs of the gpt-5.4-nano
judge model, accessed via OpenRouter: per-trajectory free-text reasoning that
quotes Qwen3-32B rollout commands and Terminal Wrench task content (Apache-2.0).
They are released as evaluation records; the judge provider's output terms apply.

